Subject: [PATCH 20/28] upstream #698: fix: property script lifecycle, layer
 bindings, text transforms and shaders

Carried from https://github.com/Almamu/linux-wallpaperengine/pull/698 (by jsilverhand48) until it is merged upstream.

Both commits of the pull request (57d6b72d), squashed. Resolved against
the series: text padding stays #652's two-component vector (it already
reads the number and the "x y" forms), jsToDynamicValue keeps #618's
corrected check and returns instead of throwing, and the ILayer
finalizer #619 added is the only one.
